WEBVTT

00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:27.420
But...

00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:03.480
Mr. Moriya.

00:02:04.030 --> 00:02:05.310
Miss Kimura.

00:02:05.660 --> 00:02:06.440
Congratulations...

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:09.520
...on your marriage!

00:02:10.150 --> 00:02:12.940
Kimura, the Japanese teacher,
and Moriya, the health teacher.

00:02:13.410 --> 00:02:15.690
They've really got guts.

00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:17.670
Especially Moriya.

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:21.240
He has... guts?

00:02:24.190 --> 00:02:26.210
Any questions so far?

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:29.630
All right...

00:02:30.780 --> 00:02:33.880
How long have you and
Miss Kimura been together?

00:02:34.760 --> 00:02:37.010
Did pistil meet stamen?

00:02:37.670 --> 00:02:40.140
Had a visit from the stork yet?

00:02:41.210 --> 00:02:43.550
Have you brought a bundle
back from the cabbage patch?

00:02:44.020 --> 00:02:45.590
Uh...

00:02:45.590 --> 00:02:47.430
When are you guys having kids?!

00:02:49.400 --> 00:02:52.180
That's par for the course, I guess.

00:02:52.180 --> 00:02:54.440
Talk about anarchy...

00:03:02.740 --> 00:03:04.080
Tell us, Miss Kimura,

00:03:04.380 --> 00:03:07.160
how did you and Mr. Moriya start dating?

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:11.430
We both grew up in the country.

00:03:11.430 --> 00:03:15.720
We got to talking about that,
and we hit it off, I guess.

00:03:16.310 --> 00:03:19.050
You had similar origins, then.

00:03:19.050 --> 00:03:19.940
Indeed.

00:03:21.640 --> 00:03:24.010
Oh, Mr. Moriya!

00:03:26.280 --> 00:03:28.120
Would you like to eat lunch together?

00:03:28.670 --> 00:03:30.340
Ah, but...

00:03:30.940 --> 00:03:32.230
Let's go.

00:03:32.740 --> 00:03:34.830
They're so in love!

00:03:34.830 --> 00:03:36.240
In love...

00:03:38.640 --> 00:03:41.520
You can't help but envy the bride-to-be.

00:03:42.880 --> 00:03:44.370
Isn't she lucky?

00:03:44.810 --> 00:03:45.720
Indeed!

00:03:45.720 --> 00:03:47.410
I-I don't...

00:03:48.140 --> 00:03:49.880
Not my thing.

00:03:50.390 --> 00:03:52.880
Wasn't it your dream in grade school

00:03:52.880 --> 00:03:55.480
to be a bride someday?

00:03:57.390 --> 00:03:59.050
When the hell was that?!

00:03:59.050 --> 00:04:01.180
When we were learning our times tables!

00:04:09.110 --> 00:04:13.030
There's someone who looks like a bride over there.

00:04:14.800 --> 00:04:16.230
Morya!

00:04:22.420 --> 00:04:24.280
She's so cute!

00:04:24.680 --> 00:04:26.450
Wh-Who is it?!

00:04:27.030 --> 00:04:30.340
It seems as though she can't speak.

00:04:32.070 --> 00:04:33.430
Morya!

00:04:36.560 --> 00:04:39.040
Being so young, her consciousness is hazy.

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:42.270
She recalls very little about her life.

00:04:43.640 --> 00:04:46.050
Things could take a bad turn, at this rate.

00:04:47.130 --> 00:04:48.470
What do you mean?

00:04:48.990 --> 00:04:53.850
Ghosts exist on this plane because they have
a lingering attachment to someone or something.

00:04:54.660 --> 00:04:59.340
But I believe this girl is losing
even her memories of that.

00:04:59.890 --> 00:05:00.750
Then...

00:05:01.150 --> 00:05:02.830
With the passage of time,

00:05:02.830 --> 00:05:07.200
she may one day vanish
before her last wish is fulfilled.

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:10.950
O-Oh no! What should we do?

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:12.040
Morya?

00:05:12.420 --> 00:05:14.380
Then let's change that!

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:17.290
Let's have her make new memories with us!

00:05:18.410 --> 00:05:20.960
I said something good though, didn't I?

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:22.470
Yeah, but it just...

00:05:22.470 --> 00:05:23.920
...pissed me off for some reason.

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:26.710
Okay!

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:29.180
Let's teach her to speak!

00:05:29.180 --> 00:05:30.210
Huh?

00:05:30.210 --> 00:05:32.670
It's better if she can talk to us, right?

00:05:32.670 --> 00:05:34.150
And maybe...

00:05:35.120 --> 00:05:36.400
Big brother.

00:05:36.400 --> 00:05:39.570
...she'll even call me that!

00:05:39.970 --> 00:05:41.860
That's the doofus Yamada.

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:43.530
Morya?

00:05:44.330 --> 00:05:45.780
Amami!

00:05:46.410 --> 00:05:47.530
Ogawa!

00:05:48.110 --> 00:05:49.950
Doofus Yamada!

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:50.870
Doofus?

00:05:51.790 --> 00:05:53.780
She's a quick learner!

00:05:53.780 --> 00:05:56.380
And this is the Flame-Haired Messiah!

00:05:57.280 --> 00:06:00.190
I <i>really</i> like that humans can be punched.

00:06:00.190 --> 00:06:02.130
Uehara!

00:06:02.780 --> 00:06:04.770
That's Inoue Narumi.

00:06:04.770 --> 00:06:05.470
Hey—

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:06.890
Narumi!

00:06:10.320 --> 00:06:12.570
That's Miss Narumi to you!
I'm older than you!

00:06:12.570 --> 00:06:14.140
She got all sweet with her back turned.

00:06:16.070 --> 00:06:18.620
Looks like she's really taken to her.

00:06:20.860 --> 00:06:23.860
On my honor... On my honor... On my honor...

00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:27.240
What are you trying to imprint
on her mind, topknot?

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:29.580
I'm in the minority. I couldn't resist...

00:06:29.890 --> 00:06:31.330
Hommer!

00:06:34.190 --> 00:06:36.820
Let's learn how to greet people today.

00:06:36.820 --> 00:06:37.820
'Kay!

00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:40.550
Hello!

00:06:42.410 --> 00:06:44.130
Very good.

00:06:48.380 --> 00:06:49.350
Narumi!

00:06:50.810 --> 00:06:52.000
Inoue!

00:06:54.920 --> 00:06:57.440
Wh-What? Quit staring at me!

00:06:58.030 --> 00:06:59.440
F-F...

00:06:59.930 --> 00:07:02.440
F-F-F...

00:07:03.430 --> 00:07:07.740
Farewell!

00:07:08.480 --> 00:07:10.780
That's another way to say goodbye.

00:07:11.100 --> 00:07:12.180
Oh.

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:14.830
Farewell!

00:07:18.110 --> 00:07:20.210
I bought some for her, too.

00:07:23.060 --> 00:07:26.160
Now we say "thank you."

00:07:27.330 --> 00:07:28.940
Thank you.

00:07:35.930 --> 00:07:38.310
Oh, shoot! That was coffee.

00:07:38.690 --> 00:07:39.850
My bad.

00:07:39.850 --> 00:07:42.610
Don't teach her that! Say "I'm sorry"!

00:07:42.610 --> 00:07:44.150
I'm sorry.

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:45.570
<i>She's</i> being taught instead?

00:07:49.720 --> 00:07:51.040
Sheesh...

00:07:51.040 --> 00:07:52.840
I didn't mean any harm.

00:07:52.840 --> 00:07:54.160
Be more careful.

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:54.990
Hey!

00:07:55.900 --> 00:07:57.410
Let's have a word chain tournament!

00:07:58.410 --> 00:08:00.880
What starts with "M"?

00:08:04.490 --> 00:08:05.670
Morya!

00:08:08.580 --> 00:08:09.600
Animal!

00:08:09.600 --> 00:08:10.820
Lather!

00:08:12.970 --> 00:08:13.890
Rum.

00:08:14.470 --> 00:08:15.640
Morya!

00:08:18.040 --> 00:08:20.510
They're too easy on her.

00:08:23.010 --> 00:08:25.690
It's fun being with everyone!

00:08:27.650 --> 00:08:29.450
Yes, it is.

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:32.490
Everyone's so big!

00:08:32.930 --> 00:08:33.950
Like, tall?

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:36.080
Well, we're grown-ups.

00:08:37.130 --> 00:08:39.620
She's really learned to speak well.

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:40.870
Yeah.

00:08:41.240 --> 00:08:44.440
She still can't remember
anything, though, can she?

00:08:44.940 --> 00:08:45.790
No.

00:08:46.360 --> 00:08:47.490
Morya!

00:08:47.980 --> 00:08:51.010
We still haven't figured out what that means.

00:08:52.040 --> 00:08:54.140
Who cares if she can't remember?

00:08:54.140 --> 00:08:57.580
She's got us as her friends now!

00:08:59.900 --> 00:09:01.820
I said something good though, didn't I?

00:09:01.820 --> 00:09:03.700
Yeah, but it still...

00:09:03.700 --> 00:09:05.310
...pissed me off for some reason.

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:11.820
Look, it's the teachers.

00:09:12.590 --> 00:09:14.700
They're as lovey-dovey as ever.

00:09:17.740 --> 00:09:19.290
Mori...ya?

00:09:21.840 --> 00:09:23.040
Moriya!

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:30.960
Moriya. Moriya...

00:09:31.680 --> 00:09:35.220
So, how does she know Mr. Moriya?
Moriya. Moriya. Moriya...

00:09:35.810 --> 00:09:38.220
Moriya's actually possessed.

00:09:38.950 --> 00:09:41.470
She was actually his secret love child.

00:09:41.990 --> 00:09:45.430
Sh-She's actually his guardian angel...

00:09:48.010 --> 00:09:49.900
Has she remembered anything else?

00:09:50.420 --> 00:09:52.400
No, not yet.

00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:57.740
Maybe we should just let her
meet Moriya face-to-face?

00:09:58.250 --> 00:10:00.620
I cannot recommend that course of action.

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:02.530
Why not?

00:10:03.660 --> 00:10:06.650
As we do not yet know who the girl truly is,

00:10:06.650 --> 00:10:08.380
we cannot predict what will happen.

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:12.430
In the unlikely event that
Master Moriya were to be harmed...

00:10:12.900 --> 00:10:15.780
How is this gonna harm anyone?

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:17.670
Moriya!

00:10:18.970 --> 00:10:21.260
I said it was unlikely!

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:23.650
Y-You're right.

00:10:23.650 --> 00:10:28.470
Mr. Moriya and Miss Kimura
are preparing for their wedding.

00:10:28.470 --> 00:10:30.230
We shouldn't make a fuss.

00:10:30.230 --> 00:10:32.780
Then I'll do some research!

00:10:32.780 --> 00:10:36.110
I'll find out how Mr. Moriya and she are linked!

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:43.280
I didn't find a thing!

00:10:44.090 --> 00:10:45.940
Don't try to gloss over it with that grin.

00:10:45.940 --> 00:10:48.400
At least act a little bit apologetic.

00:10:48.400 --> 00:10:50.290
S-Sorry...

00:10:51.150 --> 00:10:52.960
Nothing, huh?

00:10:55.630 --> 00:10:58.890
W-We'll go and try to find something out.

00:10:58.890 --> 00:10:59.800
What?

00:11:00.180 --> 00:11:01.310
But...

00:11:01.810 --> 00:11:04.760
I-It's not for you or anything.

00:11:04.760 --> 00:11:06.810
It's for Mr. Moriya and Miss Kimura.

00:11:10.490 --> 00:11:12.680
Drama queen! Drama queen!

00:11:12.680 --> 00:11:14.770
Don't teach her words like that!

00:11:17.060 --> 00:11:19.120
Well, let's get to it.

00:11:19.550 --> 00:11:21.810
Keep her company, Amami.

00:11:22.650 --> 00:11:23.880
Oh, sure.

00:11:25.290 --> 00:11:27.560
Everyone's busy?

00:11:29.220 --> 00:11:31.220
Why don't the two of us play together?

00:11:35.550 --> 00:11:37.190
U-Um...

00:11:38.240 --> 00:11:39.550
Amami?

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:41.280
Is something wrong?

00:11:41.280 --> 00:11:43.550
You look upset about something.

00:11:49.570 --> 00:11:50.810
Moriya!

00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:55.650
Da-dum, da-dum...

00:11:56.780 --> 00:11:58.250
Shut up!

00:11:58.250 --> 00:11:59.880
You'll blow our cover.

00:11:59.880 --> 00:12:01.780
Sorry, I couldn't resist...

00:12:01.780 --> 00:12:03.720
Will you guys be quiet?

00:12:03.720 --> 00:12:06.740
If the teachers catch us,
we'll be in a whole world of trouble.

00:12:06.740 --> 00:12:08.340
In trouble for what?

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:17.880
Dinner's almost ready.

00:12:18.230 --> 00:12:21.380
O-Okay, thanks...

00:12:26.920 --> 00:12:29.520
I-It really is a ghost...

00:12:29.800 --> 00:12:33.850
Yes. I'm sorry to have you spend time with her.

00:12:34.150 --> 00:12:37.190
Oh, it's fine. I mean, she's not exactly scary.

00:12:37.780 --> 00:12:38.860
Besides...

00:12:41.300 --> 00:12:44.320
She seems familiar, for some reason.

00:12:45.030 --> 00:12:47.990
All done! Eat up!

00:12:48.960 --> 00:12:51.790
A little girl's ghost wants to see Mr. Moriya?

00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:53.860
Y-Yes.

00:12:53.860 --> 00:12:56.890
She keeps saying "Moriya. Moriya..." over and over.

00:12:59.410 --> 00:13:01.090
Do you know what she looks like?

00:13:02.350 --> 00:13:05.180
She's got long hair and wears a white dress.

00:13:05.560 --> 00:13:08.750
No, it's not a dress.

00:13:08.750 --> 00:13:11.520
It's more like those gowns you wear at a hospital.

00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:13.180
This is her.

00:13:15.050 --> 00:13:16.230
It can't be...

00:13:17.590 --> 00:13:22.370
He... Mr. Moriya was actually
quite sickly as a child.

00:13:22.370 --> 00:13:24.810
He spent a lot of time in the hospital.

00:13:25.990 --> 00:13:28.740
One of his hospital stays was a long-term stay.

00:13:29.680 --> 00:13:33.180
At that time, he shared a room with a little girl.

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:38.890
They were about the same age,

00:13:38.890 --> 00:13:42.750
so they became friends quickly
and played together a lot.

00:13:43.530 --> 00:13:47.760
But sadly, she was much sicker than he was.

00:13:53.190 --> 00:13:55.020
Thank you for dinner.

00:13:55.510 --> 00:13:57.520
My pleasure.

00:13:58.140 --> 00:14:02.350
Mr. Moriya, thank you so much for today.

00:14:02.350 --> 00:14:04.070
Oh, don't mention it.

00:14:04.070 --> 00:14:06.330
It was fun experiencing something so unusual.

00:14:07.900 --> 00:14:08.930
Moriya.

00:14:10.080 --> 00:14:12.530
What should we play tomorrow?

00:14:14.510 --> 00:14:17.250
I'm sorry. I can't play tomorrow.

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:19.500
Why not?

00:14:21.570 --> 00:14:24.000
I'm getting married.

00:14:25.030 --> 00:14:28.130
Moriya, you're getting married?

00:14:29.910 --> 00:14:30.630
Yep.

00:14:32.480 --> 00:14:33.620
Oh, yeah.

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:36.930
You're big now, aren't you?

00:14:37.300 --> 00:14:40.020
You're all grown up.

00:14:41.370 --> 00:14:45.070
You can eat your carrots now.

00:14:45.420 --> 00:14:46.320
Huh?

00:15:00.300 --> 00:15:02.270
So she...

00:15:03.050 --> 00:15:07.920
She said it must be the girl Mr. Moriya
met in the hospital when he was little.

00:15:08.740 --> 00:15:11.120
If her ghost is still a child, then...

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:12.930
Yeah.

00:15:17.500 --> 00:15:19.680
A-Aren't we gonna play with her today?

00:15:22.620 --> 00:15:24.730
I'm saying I'll play with her!

00:15:25.390 --> 00:15:26.730
Inoue...

00:15:30.960 --> 00:15:32.710
She's trying so hard.

00:15:32.710 --> 00:15:34.910
And trying not to show it.

00:15:34.910 --> 00:15:37.490
What should we play, then?

00:15:40.130 --> 00:15:42.500
Okay, let's play kick-the-can!

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:44.980
You're it!

00:15:44.980 --> 00:15:47.420
Go get it!

00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:49.010
We're starting already?

00:15:54.620 --> 00:15:55.550
Amami?

00:15:56.080 --> 00:15:58.180
Would you like to play with us?

00:15:59.470 --> 00:16:00.610
Narumi.

00:16:01.050 --> 00:16:02.130
Ogawa.

00:16:02.770 --> 00:16:03.930
Uehara.

00:16:04.460 --> 00:16:05.550
Messiah.

00:16:05.550 --> 00:16:07.150
Don't call me Messiah.

00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:10.400
Doofus Yamada!

00:16:10.930 --> 00:16:12.820
Don't call me Doofus!

00:16:15.070 --> 00:16:16.970
Let's all play together!

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:27.100
Cut it out!

00:16:32.040 --> 00:16:34.410
We played a lot today, didn't we?

00:16:34.410 --> 00:16:35.550
Yeah!

00:16:35.550 --> 00:16:37.090
Did you have fun?

00:16:37.090 --> 00:16:38.100
Yeah!

00:16:38.590 --> 00:16:40.000
Good.

00:16:44.430 --> 00:16:45.310
Um...

00:16:45.970 --> 00:16:47.110
Listen...

00:16:48.340 --> 00:16:49.380
If...

00:16:50.530 --> 00:16:51.880
If you don't mind...

00:16:53.170 --> 00:16:54.200
Can...

00:16:54.890 --> 00:16:55.910
Can you...

00:16:56.770 --> 00:16:58.680
Can you stay here forever?

00:17:14.450 --> 00:17:16.010
Promise?

00:17:16.490 --> 00:17:18.260
Yeah. Promise.

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:29.020
Was that...

00:17:36.570 --> 00:17:37.690
<i>That's how she sleeps?!</i>

00:17:44.550 --> 00:17:46.180
Shall we go back to bed?

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:47.830
No...

00:17:49.740 --> 00:17:51.710
I must bid you farewell.

00:18:00.320 --> 00:18:01.960
Take care on your way.

00:18:03.810 --> 00:18:04.880
Amami.

00:18:05.530 --> 00:18:11.770
Thank you all for playing with me.

00:18:20.870 --> 00:18:21.780
Let's go.

00:18:22.980 --> 00:18:23.630
Yeah.

00:18:25.930 --> 00:18:31.060
Congratulations!

00:18:32.260 --> 00:18:33.480
Moriya!

00:18:45.920 --> 00:18:47.680
When we grow up...

00:18:48.040 --> 00:18:49.940
You're all grown up.

00:18:50.550 --> 00:18:51.650
When we're...

00:18:52.310 --> 00:18:53.650
...grown up...

00:18:57.120 --> 00:18:58.970
You're so handsome now.

00:19:04.050 --> 00:19:05.910
We'll meet again!

00:19:06.690 --> 00:19:09.840
I'm sorry I couldn't keep our promise.

00:19:11.020 --> 00:19:11.920
But...

00:19:12.860 --> 00:19:13.710
But...

00:19:14.610 --> 00:19:16.670
I still love you, Moriya!

00:19:24.160 --> 00:19:26.960
Bye-bye! Farewell!

00:19:37.640 --> 00:19:39.410
We'll take it slow.

00:19:42.730 --> 00:19:44.990
We'll make lots of stops on the way,

00:19:44.990 --> 00:19:47.200
get lots of souvenirs...

00:19:47.740 --> 00:19:50.710
And someday, we'll go and see her.

00:19:52.150 --> 00:19:54.710
Yeah... Someday.

00:19:55.620 --> 00:19:56.500
Definitely.

00:20:22.810 --> 00:20:24.910
I've gotta get to work.

00:20:25.490 --> 00:20:30.210
Skip work! Let's all have a blast together!

00:20:30.210 --> 00:20:33.120
We're all best friends, right?

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:35.090
Shut up.

00:20:35.090 --> 00:20:36.500
Have some tact!

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:39.250
Come on.

00:20:39.780 --> 00:20:41.760
Let's go have some fun.

00:20:42.240 --> 00:20:45.140
I don't like it when anyone is missing.

00:20:48.230 --> 00:20:50.840
Okay, let's go have fun!

00:20:51.370 --> 00:20:53.640
Oh, fine.

00:20:53.640 --> 00:20:55.400
Really? All right!

00:20:55.830 --> 00:20:58.030
You're paying, Yamada.

00:20:58.030 --> 00:20:59.990
What? Why?!

00:21:02.990 --> 00:21:06.740
You have to learn words
before you can use them.

00:21:09.190 --> 00:21:13.330
She didn't need to learn "farewell"...

00:21:17.360 --> 00:21:21.670
But she still said

00:21:22.490 --> 00:21:25.870
"thank you all for playing with me."

00:21:27.360 --> 00:21:28.790
Why would she say that?

00:21:29.320 --> 00:21:31.460
We could've played more!

00:21:32.580 --> 00:21:34.410
She was just a kid...

00:21:38.150 --> 00:21:39.560
Inoue.

00:21:45.330 --> 00:21:47.660
Amami, Inoue, come on!

00:21:49.480 --> 00:21:53.910
We'll hang out tomorrow,
the day after that, and beyond, too!

00:23:40.950 --> 00:23:44.120
Man, I have to do the preview? What a drag.

00:23:44.120 --> 00:23:47.030
This shouldn't be a gal's job.

00:23:47.030 --> 00:23:51.030
Anyway, Valentine's Day doesn't change much
from one generation to the next, huh?

00:23:51.030 --> 00:23:55.510
Oh, crap! Does that make
me sound like an old lady?

00:23:55.510 --> 00:24:01.240
I wonder who the secret admirer
sending Hibby chocolate is.

00:24:01.240 --> 00:24:04.830
Next time on Re-Kan!:
"The Secret Valentine."

00:24:05.620 --> 00:24:09.200
Maybe he's hoping it'll be paid back triple?
